WEBVTT

00:09:59.678 --> 00:10:01.847
And I think that is so impressive,

00:10:01.847 --> 00:10:06.435
because normally that sort of takes
years to really understand.

00:10:06.477 --> 00:10:10.105
But they got it like that,
and I just think that is huge.

00:10:10.105 --> 00:10:11.273
He said, "At that time,

00:10:11.315 --> 00:10:13.901
nobody had experienced
having a period in microgravity.

00:10:13.901 --> 00:10:15.069
Relax."

00:10:15.069 --> 00:10:16.987
(Laughter)

00:10:16.987 --> 00:10:19.239
Because really, that's what
they're angry about,

00:10:19.281 --> 00:10:21.325
as they're sitting
at their computer, like,

00:10:21.367 --> 00:10:23.410
“Stop laughing! It isn’t funny!”

00:10:24.536 --> 00:10:27.289
This next comment, this pissed me off

00:10:27.289 --> 00:10:29.416
more than anything.

00:10:29.416 --> 00:10:31.502
This type of comment, I'll just show you.